        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo MLP-211, Outswing Door Steel Mortise Latch Guard</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis heavy duty steel security door latch protector is 11\" high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building) with mortise locksets. For use on residential or commercial door applications. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nProtect your entry doors from tampering and latch prying with this heavy duty steel security latch protector plate. No special tools required for installation. Packaged with mounting hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available:  <a href=\"/products/outswing-door-stainless-steel-mortise-latch-guard-don-jo-mlp-111-630\"><b>Stainless Steel Latch Guard</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/don-jo-MLP-211_size.gif?v=1704354714\" width=\"580\" height=\"250\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Don-Jo MLP-211 Security Latch Guard size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNon-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors. Typically used with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-mortise-entrysets\"><b>Mortise Locksets</b></a> but can also be used with <a href=\"/collections/omnia-tubular-entrysets\"><b>Tube Latch Type Locksets</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Don-Jo MLP-211 Security Latch Guard\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 11\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Thickness: 12 Gauge (.104\")</li>\r\n<li>Material: Steel </li>\r\n<li>Offset: 1/4\" (.250\") </li>\r\n<li>Non-Handed (reversible)</li>\r\n<li>Fasteners: 2 each 5/16-18 x 2-1/4\" Carriage bolt with Acorn nuts and washers.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MLP-211.pdf?v=1704262262\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo MLP-211 Security Plate Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually. </b>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Outswing Door Steel Mortise Latch Guard, Don-Jo MLP-211",
                "description": "Don-Jo MLP-211 latch protectors. This heavy duty steel security door latch protector is 11  high and designed specifically for outswing doors (door opens out of the room or building) with mortise locksets. For use on residential or commercial door applications. Non-Handed, reversible for left or right hand outswinging doors.",
                "keywords": "DJO-MLP-211 Outswing Door Security Plates, front Door Security Latch Guard, Don-Jo MLP-211 latch protectors, Don-Jo MLP-211 steel door security plates, don-joe front Door Latch Guards, anti vandal plates, door Security plates, Outswing Door Stainless Security Plates, Outswing Door Steel Security Latch Guard, heavy duty Steel Mortise Latch Guard Plates, Don-Jo MLP-211-SL, Don-Jo MLP-211-DU, Don-Jo MLP-211-BP, Don-Jo MLP-211-CP"
